| `DECKO_MATERIAL_ICONS` | `local` or `stock`; any other value stops the host from starting | Unset means `stock` | Node host: `stock` keeps the reference's Material Icons stylesheet link to fonts.googleapis.com. `local` replaces that link in served pages with the copy the host serves under `/mod/bootstrap/material-icons/`. |
