## Optional deployment-specific mods

No deck-local mod ships with this package. The deck runs the gem mods alone:
the mods that ship in Decko's own Ruby gems (the `card-mod-*` gems), which
this package carries as ported TypeScript modules. The setting that names
deck-local mods to load remains:

| Setting | Values | Effect |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `DECKO_DECK_LOCAL_MODS` | Comma-separated mod names; this package knows none | Unset or blank loads none. Any name stops the deck from booting, naming the setting. |

A host with its own settings object passes it through
`configureDeckLocalMods(deckLocalModsFromEnv(env))` first.

